    "qualifications": [
      "Cloud Run buildConfig.imageUri is a reusable \":version_1\" tag shared by functions built together; it does not identify the code serving traffic. Deployed code identity is established only by the later source-archive verification, which has not run.",
      "FUNCTION_SIGNATURE_TYPE=http was added on two callables and removed on two others. http is the Functions Framework default for an HTTP target, so neither changes how those functions are invoked. Every event function keeps cloudevent unchanged.",
      "Cloud Scheduler job definitions are not part of these captures, before or after; this adjudication says nothing about them.",
      "Firestore Rules have not been deployed; this adjudication says nothing about Rules.",
      "This receipt does not replace existing-controls-proof.json. The sealed readback and closure steps do not admit it, and it authorizes nothing by itself."
    ],
